+---
+status: design-intent
+---
+
+# todo-check 行號驗證重查 Implementation Plan
+
+**Goal:** Confirm or refute the task's claim that `scripts/todo-check.js` does
+not validate a `path:line` citation's line number, and change nothing beyond
+what the answer requires.
+**Architecture:** No new subsystem. The whole of this plan is a recheck
+against the tree already at `HEAD` — `git log`, a manual repro run, and the
+existing test suite — rather than a decomposition of new code.
+**Tech Stack:** Node (`node --test`, no external dependencies), Git.
+**Spec:** [2026-09-26-todo-line-recheck-design.md](2026-09-26-todo-line-recheck-design.md)
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+Generated from `node scripts/map.js` (291 markdown files, 5 planned-not-built,
+146 retired, 8 undeclared), `.fankeel/map.md`, `package.json` and
+`CONTRIBUTING.md` — this repository has no `CLAUDE.md`.
+
+- `package.json:7-10` has `"scripts": { "test": "node --test", "clean": "node scripts/tmp-clean.js" }` and no `"dependencies"`. Add none.
+- `CONTRIBUTING.md`: `lib/` never reaches into `scripts/` or `hooks/`, only the other direction; a new or renamed doc page gets its index row in `docs/README.md` in the same change; every exported name needs an importer and a new test file has to be `git add`-ed before `tests/source.test.js` sees it.
+- `scripts/ledger.js:538` refuses `lint` on a plan with no `**Spec:**` line naming a design file that exists on disk — the reason this plan carries a design file at all, despite deciding nothing.
+- `.fankeel/map.md:77` lists `scripts/todo-check.js`'s responsibility as "whether TODO.md is still an index" — unchanged by this plan.
+
+## Zero tasks
+
+The design this plan argues from concludes the task's premise is false: the
+`past end` line-number check already exists (`02d32348`, 2026-09-25), is
+covered by `tests/todo-check.test.js:65-76`, passes 62/62 in the current
+suite, and is already recorded in `docs/README.md:144-145,149` and
+`docs/decisions/2026-09-25-todo-line-and-multiplier.md`. There is no file to
+modify and no failing test to make pass, so this plan decomposes nothing —
+the recheck itself is the deliverable, and it is already done in the design
+above.
+
+Build and verify have nothing to run beyond confirming the same evidence
+still holds at their own point in time.
